==Description==
The '''Korblox Warrior''' was a tanky enemy that exclusively appeared in [[Huevous Hunt]] as part of [[The Hunt Event]]. It had a high amount of health but it was quite slow. Additionally, on some waves, it spawned as a hidden or lead enemy, sometimes having both at once. It also had the stun, freeze and burn immunities on some waves.

==Appearance==
The '''Korblox Warrior''' had blue skin and a neon blue head. It wore a blue helmet with horns, shoulder-pads and chestplate, and grey arm-pads. The front of the chestplate was shaped like a face, with neon blue eyes and teeth, a white nose and eyebrows. It also had grey shoes, black pants and shirt.

==Strategy==
*The [[Minigunner]] and [[Accelerator]] are quite effective against the '''Korblox Warrior'''.
**As these towers also have both hidden detection and lead detection, they can be useful when the '''Korblox Warrior''' is a hidden or lead enemy.
*The [[Commander]] and [[DJ Booth]] can be quite useful at boosting the firerate and range of towers respectively.

